## 🎨 Design Details

### **Version Badge:**
- **Size:** Compact (px-3 py-1.5)
- **Icon:** Info circle (4x4)
- **Text:** "v6.3" (extra small, semibold)
- **States:**
  - Default: Gray (`slate-100` bg, `slate-600` text)
  - Hover: Darker (`slate-200` bg, `slate-900` text)
- **Cursor:** Pointer
- **Tooltip:** Informative

### **Modal:**
- **Width:** Max 3xl (48rem / 768px)
- **Height:** Max 85vh (scrollable)
- **Z-index:** 2001 (above everything)
- **Animation:** Slide up
- **Backdrop:** Blurred dark overlay

### **Change Type Icons:**
- 🆕 **New** (Green): `plus-circle`
- ⬆️ **Improved** (Blue): `arrow-up-circle`
- ✅ **Fixed** (Purple): `check-circle`

