## 🎯 User Flow

### **Accessing Version Info:**

1. User sees "v6.3" badge in header
2. User hovers → Badge darkens
3. User clicks → Modal opens
4. User sees current version tab
5. User reads highlights and changelog
6. User clicks "Version History" tab
7. User sees all previous versions
8. User clicks "Close" or clicks outside

