## 🔧 Updating Version History

To add a new version, edit the `VERSION_HISTORY` array in `index.html`:

### **Location:** Line ~1009 (after NeedsYourAttention component)

### **Steps:**
1. Find `const VERSION_HISTORY = [`
2. Add new version object at the top (array position 0)
3. Update version badge text in header
4. Update page title

### **Template:**
```javascript
{
  version: '6.4',  // New version number
  date: 'January 21, 2026',  // Release date
  title: 'Your Feature Title',  // Short title
  highlights: [  // 3-4 key features
    'Feature 1',
    'Feature 2',
    'Feature 3'
  ],
  changes: [  // Detailed changelog
    { type: 'new', text: 'New feature' },
    { type: 'improved', text: 'Enhancement' },
    { type: 'fixed', text: 'Bug fix' }
  ]
}
```

