## 🐛 Troubleshooting

**Badge not visible:**
- Check header rendering
- Verify state is initialized
- Clear browser cache

**Modal won't open:**
- Check onClick handler
- Verify showVersionInfo state
- Check console for errors

**Wrong version shown:**
- Update VERSION_HISTORY array
- Update badge text in header
- Update page title

**History not displaying:**
- Check VERSION_HISTORY structure
- Verify map() function
- Check for JavaScript errors

